email_templates.body:
Hi {{first_name}},

Based on what I know about {{company}}'s setup — {{personalized_context}} — I think a 30-minute discovery call would be worth your time.

What we cover:
• How pipeline gets created at {{company}} today
• Where the data, sequencing, or agent layer is costing you time or money
• Whether graph8's autonomous revenue system is a fit — and if so, which products map to your specific gaps

No deck. We open the product and show you the relevant surfaces — Agents, CRM, Data, Signals, Studio, or all of it — based on what you tell us.

Here are a few times that work on my end:
• {{time_option_1}}
• {{time_option_2}}
• {{time_option_3}}

Or grab a slot directly: graph8.com/demo-day

{{signature}}

